# DESIGN.md

The design contract for this project. Written once, read at the start of every session that
touches the UI. It exists so the direction survives context loss, and so "make it more X" is a
parameter change instead of a rewrite.

Keep it under ~150 lines. A design doc nobody reads is worse than none.

---

## Direction

```
Job:        <what this product's UI must make possible, one sentence>
Mode:       <Persuade | Operate | Read | Experience>  (mixed: list per surface)
Audience:   <who, on what device, in what state of attention>
Emotion:    <adj>, <adj>, <adj>
Anchor:     <concrete visual reference> — <why it fits>
Signature:  <the one move this UI is recognized by>
Rejected:   <the default direction deliberately not taken, and why>
Knobs:      VARIANCE <1-5> · MOTION <0-3> · DENSITY <1-5>
```

## Tokens

Source of truth: `<path/to/tokens.css>`. Never hardcode a value that belongs here.

| Role | Light | Dark | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| `--bg` | | | 60% of the surface |
| `--surface` | | | 30% — cards, panels |
| `--text` | | | >= 4.5:1 on bg |
| `--text-muted` | | | >= 4.5:1 on bg |
| `--border` | | | >= 3:1 when structural |
| `--accent` | | | 10% — used 2-4x per viewport |
| `--accent-fg` | | | >= 4.5:1 on accent |

Type: `<display family>` + `<text family>`, scale ratio `<n>`, base 16px.
Space: 4px base — 4 / 8 / 12 / 16 / 24 / 32 / 48 / 64 / 96.
Radius: `<sm>` / `<md>` / `<full>`. Shadows: 3 levels. Durations: 120 / 200 / 320ms.

## Locked decisions

Things that must not drift. Each with the reason, so a future session can tell whether the reason
still holds.

- <decision> — <reason>
- <decision> — <reason>

## Component conventions

- Buttons: one primary per view. Sizes: `<sm/md/lg heights>`.
- Cards: `<padding>`, `<radius>`, elevation `<level>`, border `<yes/no>`.
- Forms: labels above inputs, errors below, `<validation timing>`.
- Tables: row height `<n>px`, tabular figures, numbers right-aligned, sticky header.
- Empty states: illustration `<yes/no>` + one-line explanation + primary action.
- Icons: `<set>`, `<size>`, stroke `<width>`.

## Motion policy

- Budget: `MOTION <n>`.
- Frequent transitions <= `<n>`ms. Occasional <= `<n>`ms.
- Easing: entrances `--ease-out`, exits `--ease-in`.
- Reduced motion: `<what is removed, what is preserved>`.

## Content rules

- Voice: `<3 adjectives>`. Example of on-voice copy: "<sentence>".
- Never say: `<banned phrases>`.
- Numbers: `<format, precision, locale>`.
- Dates: `<format>`.
- Empty/error copy pattern: `<what happened> + <why> + <what to do>`.

